# The load search path (Neutrino 2.32.x port): bare names resolve through
# packages/, COZY_PATH, and the binary's own directory; misses name every
# place searched; ls falls back beside the binary for bare dir names.
load("dist"); 1
=> 1
load("dist.cz"); 1
=> 1
load("packages/dist.cz"); 1
=> 1
load("nosuch")
=> !load: cannot find 'nosuch'
length(ls("packages")) > 5
=> true
